; Ozbound level data: Hollowmere, the vertical-slice world (meadow, village, forest).
;
; Same format as assets/maps/meadow.map, plus three optional sections for the village slice.
; Lines starting with ';' are comments. Blank lines are ignored. Sections may appear in any
; order, each at most once. Required: [map], [player], [guide].
; Optional: [moonpetals], [nodes], [signs], [npcs], [places], [creatures].
;
; Coordinates are "x y" in tiles. x counts right from the left edge; y counts UP from the
; BOTTOM row of [map] (the last row listed is y = 0).
;
; [npcs]      id x y appearance Display name    (the guide is NOT listed here; id `guide` is reserved)
;             appearances: traveller, guide, apothecary, woodcutter, ferrywoman, surveyor
; [places]    id x y Display name               (targets for `visit <id>` quest objectives)
; [creatures] id x y                            (ids come from assets/bestiary/*.bestiary)
;
; Geography: a meadow in the south-west, a river at x = 20-21 crossed by the one-tile bridge
; on the main road (y = 9), a village east of the river, and a forest along the north edge.

